### Worked example
```js
const { simulate } = require('./solution.js');
const r = simulate([
  { time: 0,  acked: [[0, 10000]] },
  { time: 10, acked: [[10000, 20000]], ce: true, sent: 20000 },
  { time: 20, acked: [[20000, 30000]], sent: 30000 },
], { mss: 1000, initialCwndSegs: 10 });
// r.epochs[0].fraction   === 0.5
// r.alpha[1]             === 1*(15/16) + (1/16)*0.5
// r.epochs[0].cwndAfter  === r.epochs[0].cwndBefore * (1 - alphaAfter/2)
// r.epochs[0].cwndEpoch  === 0.7 * r.epochs[0].Wmax   // post-reduction anchor
```

Reference: RFC 9438 §4.2–4.9 (CUBIC), RFC 8257 §3.3 (DCTCP alpha/epoch), Linux `net/ipv4/tcp_dctcp.c`.

